      en: ["Bantry Bay is approximately 35 kilometers long and up to 10 kilometers wide.", "Bantry House was first constructed around 1700 by the Hutchinson family.", "The 1796 French expedition was thwarted by severe easterly gales in the bay.", "The Kilnaruane Pillar Stone is an early Christian monument from the 8th century.", "The town's population was recorded at 2,722 in the 2016 census.", "Bantry Bay accounts for a significant portion of Ireland's mussel production."],
