      en: ["Lurgan Park is the second largest public park in Ireland, spanning 250 acres.", "The town was officially established in 1610 by Sir William Brownlow.", "Brownlow House features 365 window panes, representing the days of the year.", "Lurgan was a world leader in the production of high-quality linen in the 1800s.", "The town is a key component of the Craigavon urban area established in 1965.", "Lurgan sits on the Belfast to Dublin railway corridor, facilitating easy commuting."],
